6,47)\">Ezek 16:47</ref>, 2 masculine plural <bdbheb>תַּשְׁחִתוּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 4:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,16)\">Deut 4:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 31:29\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,29)\">Deut 31:29</ref> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine singular suffix <bdbheb>הַשְׁחִיתָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:25\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,25)\">2Kgs 18:25</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 36:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,36,10)\">Isa 36:10</ref> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>הַשְׁחֵת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 31:29\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,29)\">Deut 31:29</ref> construct <bdbheb>הַשְׁחִית</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 26:15\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(9,26,15)\">1Sam 26:15</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַשְׁחִית</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 19:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,14)\">Gen 19:14</ref> +, etc.; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>spoil, ruin</highlight>, accusative crop <ref ref=\"Judg 6:4\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,4)\">Judg 6:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mal 3:11\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,11)\">Mal 3:11</ref>, trees <ref ref=\"Deut 20:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,20,19)\">Deut 20:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 20:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,20,20)\">Deut 20:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 11:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,11,19)\">Jer 11:19</ref> (figurative), vessels <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:19\" b=\"14\"