=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> (?) <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Klo')\">Klo</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bu')\">Bu</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('HPS')\">HPS</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup> <bdbheb>מְחַשְּׁבִים</bdbheb> <highlight>were devising</highlight>), <ref ref=\"Lam 2:8\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,8)\">Lam 2:8</ref>, cities and nations <ref ref=\"Gen 18:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,28)\">Gen 18:28</ref> (twice in verse) (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>, accusative omitted), <ref ref=\"Gen 19:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,13)\">Gen 19:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 19:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,14)\">Gen 19:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Isa 37:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,37,12)\">Isa 37:12</ref> (Pi`el in || <ref ref=\"2Kgs 19:12\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(12,19,12)\">2Kgs 19:12</ref>), <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"2Kgs 36:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,36,10)\">2Kgs 36:10</ref> (twice in verse) = <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:25\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,25)\">2Kgs 18:25</ref> (twice in verse) + 11 t. + (Israel personified) <ref ref=\"Deut 4:31\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,31)\">Deut 4:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 10:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,10)\">Deut 10:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 8:19\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(12,8,19)\">2Kgs 8:19</ref>, pride of Judah <ref ref=\"Jer 13:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,9)\">Jer 13:9</ref>, earth <ref ref=\"Jer 51:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,1)\">Jer 51:1</ref> absolute with adverb accusative <ref ref=\"Dan 8:24\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,24)\">Dan 8:24</ref> (see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bev')\">Bev</lookup> conjecture <bdbheb>יְשׂחֵחַ</bdbheb> or <bdbheb>יָשִׂיחַ</bdbheb> <highlight>utter monstrous things</highlight>), compare <ref ref=\"1Chr 21:12\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(13,21,12)\">1Chr 21:12</ref> Participle as adjective, of lion <ref ref=\"Jer 2:30\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(24,2,30)\">Jer 2:30</ref>, angel <ref ref=\"1Chr 21:15\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(13,21,15)\">1Chr 21:15</ref> = <highlight>destroyer</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 12:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,23)\">Exod 12:23</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Jer 22:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,22,7)\">Jer 22:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 54:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"54\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"54\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,54,16)\">Isa 54:16</ref>, <bdbheb>גּוֺיִם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 4:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,7)\">Jer 4:7</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רוּחַ מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 51:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,1)\">Jer 51:1</ref> singular collective (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַמּ</